    - target: {fileID: 3812987494493051232, guid: ddea10e42251e7e43b6ac2de41636fee, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "                                                           Audio Generator
        \n Is like the \u201Cvoice\u201D of the localizer. It creates the special
        navigation tones and identification signals that help airplanes find the
        correct path to land safely. Think of it as a smart radio painter: it draws
        very precise sound patterns that tell the pilot if the plane is too far left,
        too far right, or right on the centerline. This helps the plane stay on track
        even in bad weather.Generator for  TX1 on the left & TX2 on the right"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
